{% doc %}
  @prompt
    # Shopify AI Prompt – Responsive Collection Carousel Section
    
    Create a fully responsive **Collection Carousel** section for Shopify that works seamlessly across **desktop, tablet, and mobile** devices without layout issues, image distortion, or responsiveness problems.
    
    ## 1. Section Heading
    
    * **Heading Text:** `FIND YOUR STYLE`
    * Heading alignment: **Center**
    * All typography (font family, font size, font weight, line height, letter spacing, text transform, etc.) must be fully controlled through the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    ---
    
    ## 2. Carousel Layout
    
    * Display Type: **Carousel**
    * Desktop: **5 columns**
    * Tablet: **3 columns**
    * Mobile: **2 columns**
    * Content Alignment: **Center**
    * Section Position: **Top**
    * Item Gap:
    
      * Desktop: **20px**
      * Tablet: **16px**
      * Mobile: **12px**
    * Loop: **Enabled**
    * Auto Width: **Disabled**
    * Carousel must resize smoothly without breaking on any screen size.
    
    ---
    
    ## 3. Carousel Navigation
    
    * Navigation Arrows: **Enabled**
    * Pagination: **Dots**
    * Infinite Loop: **Enabled**
    * Autoplay: **Enabled**
    * Slide Interval: **4 seconds**
    * Pause autoplay when the user hovers over the carousel (desktop).
    * Support swipe gestures on touch devices.
    * Ensure smooth transitions without layout shifts.
    
    ---
    
    ## 4. Colors & Appearance
    
    Do **not** inherit the global color scheme.
    
    Use customizable color settings:
    
    * Background: `#FFFFFF`
    * Optional Background Gradient
    * Heading Color: `#000000`
    * Text Color: `#333333`
    * Link Color: `#007BFF`
    * Link Hover Color: `#0056B3`
    * Border Color: `#E0E0E0`
    * Shadow:
    
      ```
      0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)
      ```
    
    All colors should be configurable through theme settings.
    
    ---
    
    ## 5. Section Spacing
    
    Configurable padding values:
    
    * Top: 40px
    * Bottom: 40px
    * Left: 20px
    * Right: 20px
    
    ---
    
    ## 6. Collection Items (Maximum 12)
    
    Allow merchants to add **up to 12 collection blocks**.
    
    Each collection block must include:
    
    ### Images
    
    * Primary Image
    * Hover Image (optional)
    
    Image behavior:
    
    * Preserve the original aspect ratio.
    * Do **not** force square images.
    * Do **not** crop images unnecessarily.
    * Images should remain responsive while maintaining visual consistency.
    * Support both portrait and landscape images.
    * Prevent stretching or distortion.
    * Use responsive loading and appropriate image sizes.
    
    ### Content
    
    * Collection Title displayed below the image.
    * Typography should inherit settings from the Theme Editor.
    
    ### Link
    
    * Collection URL
    * Option to open in a new tab.
    * Toggle:
    
      * Hide on Tablet
      * Hide on Mobile
    
    ### Overlay
    
    * Content Overlay: Disabled
    
    ---
    
    ## 7. Display Rules
    
    Only display collection blocks that have a valid uploaded image.
    
    Examples:
    
    * If 12 collections are added, display all 12.
    * If only 5 collections contain images, display only those 5.
    * Empty collection blocks must never appear on the storefront.
    
    ---
    
    ## 8. Hover Effects
    
    Desktop only:
    
    * Scale Image:
    
      ```
      transform: scale(1.05)
      ```
    * Hover Shadow:
    
      ```
      0 6px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.15)
      ```
    * Smooth animation (300ms)
    
    Disable hover effects on touch devices.
    
    ---
    
    ## 9. Responsive Requirements
    
    The section **must be fully responsive** and optimized for all devices.
    
    ### Desktop
    
    * 5 columns
    * 20px gap
    * Navigation arrows visible
    * Pagination visible
    
    ### Tablet
    
    * 3 columns
    * 16px gap
    * Swipe support
    * Responsive image sizing
    * Proper spacing without overflow
    
    ### Mobile
    
    * 2 columns
    * 12px gap
    * Swipe gestures enabled
    * Touch-friendly navigation
    * No horizontal page overflow
    * Images remain sharp and correctly proportioned
    * Maintain smooth scrolling and transitions
    
    ---
    
    ## 10. Performance Requirements
    
    * Lazy-load collection images.
    * Optimize images using Shopify's image URL filters.
    * Prevent CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift).
    * Ensure smooth carousel performance with minimal JavaScript.
    * Avoid unnecessary DOM rendering.
    * Maintain accessibility (ARIA labels, keyboard navigation, focus states).
    
    ---
    
    ## 11. Key Requirements
    
    * Preserve natural image aspect ratios.
    * Never force square thumbnails.
    * No image stretching or distortion.
    * Responsive layout across desktop, tablet, and mobile.
    * Carousel should adapt automatically to screen size.
    * Smooth autoplay, swipe, arrows, and pagination.
    * Theme Editor should control all typography, colors, spacing, and carousel settings.
    * Only display collections with uploaded images.
    * Build the section following Shopify Online Store 2.0 best practices, using clean, maintainable Liquid, CSS, and JavaScript., Carousel Not Working Can you make it proper that carousel work properly 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-collection-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    {% if block.settings.background_gradient != blank %}
      background: {{ block.settings.background_gradient }};
    {% endif %}
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.padding_right }}px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px {{ block.settings.padding_left }}px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: {{ block.settings.heading_alignment }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.heading_spacing }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.heading_line_height }};
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.heading_letter_spacing }}em;
    text-transform: {{ block.settings.heading_text_transform }};
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.item_gap_desktop }}px;
    transition: transform 0.4s ease-in-out;
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 0 0 calc((100% - ({{ block.settings.columns_desktop | minus: 1 }} * {{ block.settings.item_gap_desktop }}px)) / {{ block.settings.columns_desktop }});
    max-width: calc((100% - ({{ block.settings.columns_desktop | minus: 1 }} * {{ block.settings.item_gap_desktop }}px)) / {{ block.settings.columns_desktop }});
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.item_border_radius }}px;
    border: {{ block.settings.item_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};
    box-shadow: {{ block.settings.shadow }};
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) {
    .ai-collection-carousel-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
      transform: scale(1.05);
      box-shadow: {{ block.settings.hover_shadow }};
    }

    .ai-collection-carousel-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-collection-carousel-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      opacity: 0;
    }

    .ai-collection-carousel-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-collection-carousel-hover-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-image-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-collection-carousel-hover-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-hover-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: {{ block.settings.title_padding }}px;
    text-align: center;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-family: {{ block.settings.title_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.title_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.title_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.title_line_height }};
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.title_letter_spacing }}em;
    text-transform: {{ block.settings.title_text_transform }};
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    background: {{ block.settings.arrow_background }};
    border: {{ block.settings.arrow_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.arrow_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.arrow_border_radius }}px;
    width: {{ block.settings.arrow_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.arrow_size }}px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    z-index: 10;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    color: {{ block.settings.arrow_color }};
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background: {{ block.settings.arrow_hover_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.arrow_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}.prev {
    left: {{ block.settings.arrow_offset }}px;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}.next {
    right: {{ block.settings.arrow_offset }}px;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: {{ block.settings.arrow_icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.arrow_icon_size }}px;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-pagination-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.pagination_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.dot_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.dot_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: {{ block.settings.pagination_color }};
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    background: {{ block.settings.pagination_active_color }};
    transform: scale(1.2);
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-collection-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: {{ block.settings.item_gap_tablet }}px;
    }

    .ai-collection-carousel-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc((100% - ({{ block.settings.columns_tablet | minus: 1 }} * {{ block.settings.item_gap_tablet }}px)) / {{ block.settings.columns_tablet }});
      max-width: calc((100% - ({{ block.settings.columns_tablet | minus: 1 }} * {{ block.settings.item_gap_tablet }}px)) / {{ block.settings.columns_tablet }});
    }

    .ai-collection-carousel-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-collection-carousel-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    {% if block.settings.hide_arrows_tablet %}
      .ai-collection-carousel-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
        display: none;
      }
    {% endif %}
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-collection-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top | times: 0.7 }}px {{ block.settings.padding_right | times: 0.7 }}px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom | times: 0.7 }}px {{ block.settings.padding_left | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-collection-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: {{ block.settings.item_gap_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-collection-carousel-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc((100% - ({{ block.settings.columns_mobile | minus: 1 }} * {{ block.settings.item_gap_mobile }}px)) / {{ block.settings.columns_mobile }});
      max-width: calc((100% - ({{ block.settings.columns_mobile | minus: 1 }} * {{ block.settings.item_gap_mobile }}px)) / {{ block.settings.columns_mobile }});
    }

    .ai-collection-carousel-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-collection-carousel-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size | times: 0.85 }}px;
    }

    .ai-collection-carousel-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    @media (hover: hover) {
      .ai-collection-carousel-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
        transform: none;
        box-shadow: {{ block.settings.shadow }};
      }

      .ai-collection-carousel-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-collection-carousel-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
        opacity: 1;
      }

      .ai-collection-carousel-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-collection-carousel-hover-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
        opacity: 0;
      }
    }
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.hide-tablet {
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.hide-mobile {
    display: block;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-collection-carousel-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.hide-tablet {
      display: none !important;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-collection-carousel-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.hide-mobile {
      display: none !important;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<collection-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-collection-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-collection-carousel-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
      <h2 class="ai-collection-carousel-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-collection-carousel-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-collection-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% for i in (1..12) %}
          {% liquid
            assign collection_key = 'collection_' | append: i
            assign collection = block.settings[collection_key]
            assign image_key = 'image_' | append: i
            assign image = block.settings[image_key]
            assign hover_image_key = 'hover_image_' | append: i
            assign hover_image = block.settings[hover_image_key]
            assign title_key = 'title_' | append: i
            assign title = block.settings[title_key]
            assign url_key = 'url_' | append: i
            assign url = block.settings[url_key]
            assign open_new_tab_key = 'open_new_tab_' | append: i
            assign open_new_tab = block.settings[open_new_tab_key]
            assign hide_tablet_key = 'hide_tablet_' | append: i
            assign hide_tablet = block.settings[hide_tablet_key]
            assign hide_mobile_key = 'hide_mobile_' | append: i
            assign hide_mobile = block.settings[hide_mobile_key]
          %}

          {% if image != blank %}
            <div 
              class="ai-collection-carousel-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}{% if hide_tablet %} hide-tablet{% endif %}{% if hide_mobile %} hide-mobile{% endif %}"
              data-hide-tablet="{{ hide_tablet }}"
              data-hide-mobile="{{ hide_mobile }}"
            >
              <a 
                href="{% if url != blank %}{{ url }}{% elsif collection != blank %}{{ collection.url }}{% else %}#{% endif %}"
                class="ai-collection-carousel-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                {% if open_new_tab %}target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"{% endif %}
              >
                <div class="ai-collection-carousel-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <img
                    src="{{ image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                    alt="{{ image.alt | default: title | escape }}"
                    loading="lazy"
                    width="{{ image.width }}"
                    height="{{ image.height }}"
                    class="ai-collection-carousel-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  >
                  {% if hover_image != blank %}
                    <img
                      src="{{ hover_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                      alt="{{ hover_image.alt | default: title | escape }}"
                      loading="lazy"
                      width="{{ hover_image.width }}"
                      height="{{ hover_image.height }}"
                      class="ai-collection-carousel-hover-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                    >
                  {% endif %}
                </div>
                {% if title != blank %}
                  <div class="ai-collection-carousel-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ title }}</div>
                {% elsif collection != blank %}
                  <div class="ai-collection-carousel-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ collection.title }}</div>
                {% endif %}
              </a>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      {% if block.settings.show_arrows %}
        <button class="ai-collection-carousel-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} prev" aria-label="Previous slide">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <button class="ai-collection-carousel-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} next" aria-label="Next slide">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </button>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    {% if block.settings.show_pagination %}
      <div class="ai-collection-carousel-pagination-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</collection-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class CollectionCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.currentIndex = 0;
        this.autoplayInterval = null;
        this.isTransitioning = false;
        this.touchStartX = 0;
        this.touchEndX = 0;
        this.resizeTimeout = null;
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.track = this.querySelector('.ai-collection-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.items = Array.from(this.querySelectorAll('.ai-collection-carousel-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}'));
        this.prevBtn = this.querySelector('.ai-collection-carousel-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}.prev');
        this.nextBtn = this.querySelector('.ai-collection-carousel-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}.next');
        this.pagination = this.querySelector('.ai-collection-carousel-pagination-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.wrapper = this.querySelector('.ai-collection-carousel-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}');

        this.settings = {
          autoplay: {{ block.settings.enable_autoplay }},
          interval: {{ block.settings.autoplay_interval | times: 1000 }},
          loop: {{ block.settings.enable_loop }},
          pauseOnHover: {{ block.settings.pause_on_hover }},
          desktopColumns: {{ block.settings.columns_desktop }},
          tabletColumns: {{ block.settings.columns_tablet }},
          mobileColumns: {{ block.settings.columns_mobile }}
        };

        if (this.items.length === 0) return;

        this.init();
      }

      init() {
        this.updateVisibleItems();
        this.setupEventListeners();
        this.updatePagination();
        this.updateSlidePosition();
        
        if (this.settings.autoplay) {
          this.startAutoplay();
        }
      }

      getColumnsPerView() {
        const width = window.innerWidth;
        if (width <= 749) return this.settings.mobileColumns;
        if (width <= 989) return this.settings.tabletColumns;
        return this.settings.desktopColumns;
      }

      updateVisibleItems() {
        const width = window.innerWidth;
        this.visibleItems = this.items.filter(item => {
          const hideTablet = item.dataset.hideTablet === 'true';
          const hideMobile = item.dataset.hideMobile === 'true';
          
          if (width <= 749 && hideMobile) {
            return false;
          }
          if (width > 749 && width <= 989 && hideTablet) {
            return false;
          }
          return true;
        });

        const columnsPerView = this.getColumnsPerView();
        if (this.visibleItems.length <= columnsPerView) {
          if (this.prevBtn) this.prevBtn.style.display = 'none';
          if (this.nextBtn) this.nextBtn.style.display = 'none';
          if (this.pagination) this.pagination.style.display = 'none';
        } else {
          if (this.prevBtn) this.prevBtn.style.display = 'flex';
          if (this.nextBtn) this.nextBtn.style.display = 'flex';
          if (this.pagination) this.pagination.style.display = 'flex';
        }
      }

      getTotalSlides() {
        const columnsPerView = this.getColumnsPerView();
        const visibleCount = this.visibleItems.length;
        
        if (visibleCount <= columnsPerView) {
          return 1;
        }
        
        return visibleCount - columnsPerView + 1;
      }

      setupEventListeners() {
        if (this.prevBtn) {
          this.prevBtn.addEventListener('click', () => this.prev());
        }
        
        if (this.nextBtn) {
          this.nextBtn.addEventListener('click', () => this.next());
        }

        this.track.addEventListener('touchstart', (e) => {
          this.touchStartX = e.changedTouches[0].screenX;
        }, { passive: true });

        this.track.addEventListener('touchend', (e) => {
          this.touchEndX = e.changedTouches[0].screenX;
          this.handleSwipe();
        }, { passive: true });

        if (this.settings.pauseOnHover && this.settings.autoplay) {
          this.wrapper.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => this.stopAutoplay());
          this.wrapper.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => this.startAutoplay());
        }

        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {
          clearTimeout(this.resizeTimeout);
          this.resizeTimeout = setTimeout(() => {
            this.currentIndex = 0;
            this.updateVisibleItems();
            this.updatePagination();
            this.updateSlidePosition();
          }, 150);
        });
      }

      handleSwipe() {
        const swipeThreshold = 50;
        const diff = this.touchStartX - this.touchEndX;

        if (Math.abs(diff) > swipeThreshold) {
          if (diff > 0) {
            this.next();
          } else {
            this.prev();
          }
        }
      }

      updateSlidePosition() {
        if (!this.visibleItems.length) return;

        const firstVisibleItem = this.visibleItems[0];
        if (!firstVisibleItem) return;

        const itemWidth = firstVisibleItem.offsetWidth;
        const gap = parseInt(getComputedStyle(this.track).gap) || 0;
        
        let offset = 0;
        for (let i = 0; i < this.currentIndex && i < this.visibleItems.length; i++) {
          offset += this.visibleItems[i].offsetWidth + gap;
        }

        this.track.style.transform = `translateX(-${offset}px)`;
        this.updatePaginationDots();
      }

      next() {
        if (this.isTransitioning) return;

        const totalSlides = this.getTotalSlides();
        
        if (totalSlides <= 1) return;

        if (this.currentIndex < totalSlides - 1) {
          this.currentIndex++;
        } else if (this.settings.loop) {
          this.currentIndex = 0;
        } else {
          return;
        }

        this.updateSlidePosition();
      }

      prev() {
        if (this.isTransitioning) return;

        const totalSlides = this.getTotalSlides();
        
        if (totalSlides <= 1) return;

        if (this.currentIndex > 0) {
          this.currentIndex--;
        } else if (this.settings.loop) {
          this.currentIndex = totalSlides - 1;
        } else {
          return;
        }

        this.updateSlidePosition();
      }

      updatePagination() {
        if (!this.pagination) return;

        const totalSlides = this.getTotalSlides();
        this.pagination.innerHTML = '';

        if (totalSlides <= 1) {
          this.pagination.style.display = 'none';
          return;
        }

        this.pagination.style.display = 'flex';

        for (let i = 0; i < totalSlides; i++) {
          const dot = document.createElement('button');
          dot.classList.add('ai-collection-carousel-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
          dot.setAttribute('aria-label', `Go to slide ${i + 1}`);
          dot.addEventListener('click', () => {
            this.currentIndex = i;
            this.updateSlidePosition();
          });
          this.pagination.appendChild(dot);
        }

        this.updatePaginationDots();
      }

      updatePaginationDots() {
        if (!this.pagination) return;

        const dots = this.pagination.querySelectorAll('.ai-collection-carousel-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        dots.forEach((dot, index) => {
          if (index === this.currentIndex) {
            dot.classList.add('active');
          } else {
            dot.classList.remove('active');
          }
        });
      }

      startAutoplay() {
        if (!this.settings.autoplay) return;
        
        this.stopAutoplay();
        this.autoplayInterval = setInterval(() => {
          this.next();
        }, this.settings.interval);
      }

      stopAutoplay() {
        if (this.autoplayInterval) {
          clearInterval(this.autoplayInterval);
          this.autoplayInterval = null;
        }
      }

      disconnectedCallback() {
        this.stopAutoplay();
        if (this.resizeTimeout) {
          clearTimeout(this.resizeTimeout);
        }
      }
    }

    customElements.define('collection-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}', CollectionCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

